<title>USA: Micron Electronics in $325 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Micron Electronics in $325 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>NAMPA, Idaho 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Electronics Inc said it had filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to $325 million in common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it may offer the securities in the future from time to time.</p>
<p>It said the offering may be used to fund additional expansion of its contract manufacturing and PC operations.</p>
</text>
